<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged up to 15,000 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged up to 15,000 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged up to 15,000 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,500 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 29	    October 28</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,000		  15,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.509 million	    $1.735 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
